eskythlikesclouds/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nv4.6.dev3.official [9d84f3d13]\nv4.5.stable.official [876b29033]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.6.dev3 - Windows 11 (build 26100) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated AMD Radeon RX 9070 XT (Advanced Micro Devices, Inc.; 32.0.22021.1009) - AMD Ryzen 7 7800X3D 8-Core Processor (16 threads) - 63.10 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhile testing the new SSR implementation in 4.6-dev3, I have noticed that the reflections start to jump/stutter at certain camera angles which is especially noticeable during smooth camera movements. I could also reproduce this with the old SSR implementation in 4.5, although there it is only visible if the max steps set to 256 or higher, otherwise the reflections weren't long enough.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nVideo showing the issue:\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/113900ab-1fe5-4b10-996d-f5767301bb44\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n1. Open the project\n2. Open ssr.tscn\n3. Select the Camera3D in the scene, in the viewport enable Camera Preview\n4. Select the AnimationPlayer node\n5. Play the \"animation1\" Animation\n\nAfter that the reflection on the floor are not moving smoothly but instead are jumping between some of the frames.\n(I have also included a second Animation \"animation2\" where the effect is slightly less noticable)\n\n[ssr-mrp.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/23438955/ssr-mrp.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112580/reactions","total_count":5,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":3},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112580/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}